    "custom_liquid_nPbyNJ": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% assign bfx16_uid = section.id | default: 't16-bowflex-aplus' %}\n<section class=\"bfx16\" id=\"bfx16-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" aria-label=\"Discover the BowFlex T16 folding treadmill\">\n  <div class=\"bfx16-wrap\">\n    <header class=\"bfx16-hero bfx16-card\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-hero-copy\">\n        <img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-logo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/bowflex-logo.svg?v=1771947855&amp;width=360\" width=\"300\" height=\"61\" alt=\"BowFlex\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n        <p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">T16 CONNECTED FOLDING TREADMILL</p>\n        <h2>Your run.<br>Your next flex<span class=\"bfx16-dot\">.</span></h2>\n        <p class=\"bfx16-lead\">Go Flex with the T16. A 15.6-inch HD touchscreen, a spacious cushioned deck and connected training that moves with you.</p>\n        <div class=\"bfx16-actions\"><a class=\"bfx16-button\" href=\"#bfx16-film-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\">See it in motion <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><a class=\"bfx16-text-link\" href=\"#bfx16-specs-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\">Explore the details</a></div>\n        <a class=\"bfx16-offer-link\" href=\"#bfx16-jrny-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\"><span class=\"bfx16-status\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> 2 months of JRNY free with your T16 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bfx16-hero-media\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1600\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=900 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200 1200w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1600 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 94vw, 740px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Complete BowFlex T16 treadmill with its running deck open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><span class=\"bfx16-floating-label\">Made for your next chapter.</span></div>\n    </header>\n\n    <dl class=\"bfx16-highlights\" aria-label=\"T16 at a glance\">\n      <div><dt>HD touchscreen</dt><dd>15.6<span> inch</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Top speed</dt><dd>20<span> km/h</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Motorised incline</dt><dd>15<span>%</span></dd></div>\n      <div><dt>Running area</dt><dd>152 × 56<span> cm</span></dd></div>\n    </dl>\n\n    <section class=\"bfx16-film bfx16-card\" id=\"bfx16-film-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" aria-label=\"Watch the BowFlex T16 product film\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">TAKE A CLOSER LOOK</p><h2>Meet your next routine.</h2></div><p>See the T16 in action, from your first step to your next challenge.</p></div>\n      <video class=\"bfx16-video\" controls playsinline preload=\"none\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" poster=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_3.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1500\" aria-label=\"BowFlex T16 treadmill product demonstration\"><source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/bd14aa0543204f1088bd0c160aafc2f3.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">Your browser does not support embedded video. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/bd14aa0543204f1088bd0c160aafc2f3.mp4\">Watch the T16 video</a>.</video>\n    </section>\n\n    <article class=\"bfx16-split bfx16-card\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">THE BIGGER PICTURE</p><h2>A touchscreen.<br>A thousand reasons<br>to keep moving.</h2><p>The <strong>15.6-inch HD touchscreen</strong> puts your training and entertainment within easy reach. Access JRNY digital fitness, or enjoy apps including Netflix, Prime Video and Spotify using your own accounts.</p><p>Choose the workout, playlist or next episode that helps you find your rhythm.</p><ul class=\"bfx16-tags\" aria-label=\"Entertainment apps\"><li>Netflix</li><li>Prime Video</li><li>Spotify</li></ul><p class=\"bfx16-note\">Wi-Fi required for connected apps. Streaming subscriptions are separate.</p></div>\n      <figure class=\"bfx16-photo\"><img class=\"bfx16-image \" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web1.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web1.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web1.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web1.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=900 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web1.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 600px\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"Runner using the BowFlex T16 with entertainment visible on its touchscreen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"bfx16-photo-caption\">Your session. Your screen.</figcaption></figure>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"bfx16-split bfx16-split-reverse bfx16-card\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">CONNECT. STEP ON. GO.</p><h2>Your watch.<br>Part of your workout.</h2><p>Connect a compatible <strong>Apple Watch or Samsung Galaxy Watch</strong> to keep your workout metrics in sync.</p><p>Heart rate contact grips and compatibility with Bluetooth heart rate monitors give you additional ways to follow your effort.</p><ul class=\"bfx16-tags\" aria-label=\"Smartwatch connectivity\"><li>Apple Watch</li><li>Samsung Galaxy Watch</li></ul><p class=\"bfx16-note\">Compatibility depends on your watch model and software. Personal devices shown are for illustration.</p></div>\n      <figure class=\"bfx16-photo\"><img class=\"bfx16-image \" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_4.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_4.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_4.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_4.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=900 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_4.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 600px\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"Person connecting a smartwatch at the BowFlex T16 console\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"bfx16-photo-caption\">Keep your metrics together.</figcaption></figure>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"bfx16-drive bfx16-card\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">SMALL ADJUSTMENT. BIG DIFFERENCE.</p><h2>Change pace.<br>Keep your flow<span class=\"bfx16-dot\">.</span></h2><p><strong>Quick Dial speed and incline controls</strong> make changing your effort simple. Turn the dial to adjust your session without repeatedly reaching for the touchscreen.</p><p>The <strong>MaxReact Drive System</strong> responds rapidly to speed and incline changes, making it well suited to fast-paced interval training.</p><div class=\"bfx16-drive-stats\"><div><strong>20 <small>km/h</small></strong><span>Top speed</span></div><div><strong>15<small>%</small></strong><span>Maximum incline</span></div></div></div>\n      <fieldset class=\"bfx16-console-media bfx16-gallery bfx16-console-gallery\"><legend class=\"bfx16-sr\">Choose a console angle</legend><div class=\"bfx16-gallery-controls\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-console-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"front\" checked><span>Front</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-console-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"left\"><span>Left angle</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-console-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"right\"><span>Right angle</span></label></div><div class=\"bfx16-gallery-frames\"><figure data-bfx16-angle=\"front\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 640px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Front view of the T16 touchscreen console, Quick Dial controls and hand grips\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Front</figcaption></figure><figure data-bfx16-angle=\"left\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroL-ID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroL-ID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroL-ID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 640px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Left angle of the T16 touchscreen console and hand grips\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Left angle</figcaption></figure><figure data-bfx16-angle=\"right\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroR-ID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroR-ID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_ConsoleHeroR-ID.png?v=1795772625&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 640px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Right angle of the T16 touchscreen console and hand grips\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption>Right angle</figcaption></figure></div></fieldset>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"bfx16-split bfx16-card\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">ROOM TO FIND YOUR STRIDE</p><h2>Go a little further.<br>Feel right at home.</h2><p>The <strong>Flex Zone XL Deck System</strong> gives you a spacious <strong>152 × 56 cm running area</strong>, with room for everyday walks, steady jogs and longer runs.</p><p>Flex Zone cushioning supports your stride, while motorised incline adds another way to vary the challenge.</p><div class=\"bfx16-deck-measure\"><strong>56 cm</strong><span>Wide running surface</span></div></div>\n      <figure class=\"bfx16-photo\"><img class=\"bfx16-image \" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_3.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_3.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_3.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_3.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=900 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_3.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 600px\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"Woman running on the T16 in a bright home workout space\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"bfx16-photo-caption\">152 cm long. 56 cm wide. All yours.</figcaption></figure>\n    </article>\n\n    <div class=\"bfx16-comfort-grid\" aria-label=\"Thoughtful details for your workout\">\n      <article class=\"bfx16-mini bfx16-card\"><span class=\"bfx16-number\">01</span><h3>Stay comfortable.</h3><p>A built-in fan helps you stay comfortable as your session builds.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"bfx16-mini bfx16-card\"><span class=\"bfx16-number\">02</span><h3>Bring your soundtrack.</h3><p>Bluetooth-enabled speakers let you add audio to your workout.</p></article>\n      <article class=\"bfx16-mini bfx16-card\"><span class=\"bfx16-number\">03</span><h3>Keep water close.</h3><p>A water bottle holder keeps your drink within reach between efforts.</p></article>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"bfx16-jrny bfx16-card\" id=\"bfx16-jrny-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" aria-label=\"Two months free JRNY membership with your T16 purchase\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-jrny-logo\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/JRNY_Icon_1.png?v=1795799314&amp;width=360\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/JRNY_Icon_1.png?v=1795799314&amp;width=360 360w\" sizes=\"76px\" width=\"590\" height=\"590\" alt=\"JRNY\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">WITH YOUR T16 PURCHASE</p><h2>Your next chapter.<br><span>2 months on us.</span></h2><p>Get a <strong>two-month JRNY Mobile-Only membership trial</strong> with your T16 and discover more ways to make training your own.</p><p>JRNY offers adaptive workouts, trainer-led sessions and Explore the World scenic routes. The JRNY App membership is also compatible with the T16 touchscreen.</p><ul class=\"bfx16-jrny-features\"><li>Adaptive workouts</li><li>Trainer-led sessions</li><li>Scenic routes</li></ul><a class=\"bfx16-button bfx16-button-light\" href=\"https://jrny.com/intl/home\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Explore JRNY <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a><p class=\"bfx16-trial-terms\">For eligible new JRNY members. Membership auto-renews annually at the then-current rate unless cancelled at least 48 hours before the free period ends. Review current JRNY terms at activation. Streaming subscriptions are not included.</p></div>\n      <fieldset class=\"bfx16-jrny-gallery bfx16-gallery\"><legend class=\"bfx16-sr\">Explore JRNY on the T16</legend><div class=\"bfx16-gallery-controls\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-jrny-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"app\" checked><span>Your JRNY app</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-jrny-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"scenery\"><span>Scenic routes</span></label></div><div class=\"bfx16-gallery-frames\"><figure class=\"bfx16-photo\" data-bfx16-scene=\"app\"><img class=\"bfx16-image \" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_2.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_2.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_2.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 640px\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"Woman using the JRNY app on a tablet at the BowFlex T16\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"bfx16-photo-caption\">Your JRNY app</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"bfx16-photo\" data-bfx16-scene=\"scenery\"><img class=\"bfx16-image \" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_5.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_5.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web_5.jpg?v=1795775545&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 640px\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"Woman training on the T16 while a scenic route appears on its touchscreen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"bfx16-photo-caption\">Scenic routes</figcaption></figure></div></fieldset>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bfx16-fold bfx16-card\" aria-label=\"T16 folding and storage\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">A WORKOUT SPACE THAT WORKS FOR YOU</p><h2>Train.<br>Fold.<br>Make room.</h2><p>The T16’s folding design reduces its footprint between sessions. Compare the treadmill in use, inclined and folded to plan your home training space.</p><p class=\"bfx16-note\">Machine dimensions are shown below. Allow the additional operating and safety clearances specified in the owner’s manual.</p></div>\n      <fieldset class=\"bfx16-fold-view bfx16-gallery\"><legend class=\"bfx16-sr\">Compare the T16 in use, inclined and folded</legend><div class=\"bfx16-gallery-controls\"><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-position-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"open\" checked><span>In use</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-position-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"incline\"><span>Inclined</span></label><label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"bfx16-position-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" value=\"folded\"><span>Folded</span></label></div><div class=\"bfx16-fold-frames\"><figure data-bfx16-view=\"open\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Right.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 700px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Side profile of the BowFlex T16 with its running deck open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>196 × 94 × 171.6 cm</strong><span>Assembled · L × W × H</span></figcaption></figure><figure data-bfx16-view=\"incline\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Incline.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Incline.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_Incline.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 700px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Side profile of the BowFlex T16 with its running deck inclined\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Up to 15% motorised incline</strong><span>A closer look at hill training</span></figcaption></figure><figure data-bfx16-view=\"folded\"><img class=\"bfx16-image bfx16-product-image\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_FoldL.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_FoldL.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/T16-21_FoldL.png?v=1795772626&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 700px\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2400\" alt=\"Left profile of the BowFlex T16 with its running deck folded upright\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>123.5 × 94 × 171.6 cm</strong><span>Stowed · L × W × H</span></figcaption></figure></div></fieldset>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bfx16-specs bfx16-card\" id=\"bfx16-specs-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" aria-label=\"BowFlex T16 UK specifications\">\n      <div class=\"bfx16-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">EVERY DETAIL. AT A GLANCE.</p><h2>Get to know your T16.</h2></div><p>UK measurements, from the screen to the running surface.</p></div><dl class=\"bfx16-spec-grid\"><div><dt>Model</dt><dd>BowFlex T16-21</dd></div><div><dt>Display</dt><dd>15.6-inch HD touchscreen</dd></div><div><dt>Top speed</dt><dd>20 km/h</dd></div><div><dt>Motorised incline</dt><dd>Up to 15%</dd></div><div><dt>Running area</dt><dd>152 × 56 cm</dd></div><div><dt>Drive system</dt><dd>MaxReact</dd></div><div><dt>Cushioning</dt><dd>Flex Zone XL Deck System</dd></div><div><dt>Speed &amp; incline controls</dt><dd>Quick Dial</dd></div><div><dt>Smartwatch connection</dt><dd>Compatible Apple Watch &amp; Samsung Galaxy Watch</dd></div><div><dt>Heart rate monitoring</dt><dd>Contact grips &amp; Bluetooth heart rate monitor compatibility</dd></div><div><dt>Fitness apps</dt><dd>JRNY; Peloton, Kinomap &amp; Zwift via your phone or tablet</dd></div><div><dt>Audio</dt><dd>Bluetooth-enabled speakers</dd></div><div><dt>Everyday comfort</dt><dd>Built-in fan &amp; water bottle holder</dd></div><div><dt>Folding design</dt><dd>Yes</dd></div><div><dt>Maximum user weight</dt><dd>170 kg</dd></div><div><dt>Assembled product weight</dt><dd>128 kg</dd></div><div><dt>Assembled dimensions</dt><dd>196 × 94 × 171.6 cm (L × W × H)</dd></div><div><dt>Stowed dimensions</dt><dd>123.5 × 94 × 171.6 cm (L × W × H)</dd></div></dl><p class=\"bfx16-note bfx16-spec-note\">Wi-Fi is required for connected touchscreen apps. Connected fitness and streaming services may require separate subscriptions. Membership is required for the full JRNY experience.</p>\n    </section>\n\n    <article class=\"bfx16-home bfx16-card\"><div class=\"bfx16-copy\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">A PLACE TO START. ROOM TO PROGRESS.</p><h2>Make space<br>for your next flex<span class=\"bfx16-dot\">.</span></h2><p>A daily walk. A new running goal. A workout that fits around the rest of your day. The T16 brings your training, entertainment and connected tech together at home.</p><a class=\"bfx16-text-link\" href=\"#bfx16-faq-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\">A few questions before you begin <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></a></div><figure class=\"bfx16-photo\"><img class=\"bfx16-image \" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web-6.jpg?v=1795775546&amp;width=1200\" srcset=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web-6.jpg?v=1795775546&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web-6.jpg?v=1795775546&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web-6.jpg?v=1795775546&amp;width=900 900w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1019/0431/8794/files/web-6.jpg?v=1795775546&amp;width=1200 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 749px) 92vw, 600px\" width=\"1500\" height=\"1500\" alt=\"Woman training on a BowFlex T16 in a home gym with strength equipment\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption class=\"bfx16-photo-caption\">Your space. Your pace.</figcaption></figure></article>\n\n    <section class=\"bfx16-faq\" id=\"bfx16-faq-{{ bfx16_uid | escape }}\" aria-label=\"BowFlex T16 frequently asked questions\"><div class=\"bfx16-faq-heading\"><p class=\"bfx16-kicker\">THE ANSWERS, WITHOUT THE GUESSWORK</p><h2>Before your<br>first run.</h2><p>Common questions about the BowFlex T16 treadmill, its apps and your home setup.</p></div><div class=\"bfx16-faq-list\"><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\" open><summary><span>Do I need a paid JRNY subscription to use the BowFlex T16?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>No. A paid JRNY subscription is optional for treadmill use. You can use the T16’s basic treadmill functions without a paid membership. A membership is required for the full JRNY experience.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Does the BowFlex T16 include a free JRNY trial?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Your T16 purchase includes a two-month JRNY Mobile-Only membership trial for eligible new JRNY members. The JRNY App tier is also compatible with the T16 touchscreen. The subscription renews at the then-current annual rate unless cancelled at least 48 hours before the free period ends. Review the current JRNY terms when activating. Streaming subscriptions are separate.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Can I watch Netflix or Prime Video on the T16?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Yes. The 15.6-inch HD touchscreen provides access to apps including Netflix, Prime Video and Spotify. Wi-Fi is required for connected entertainment. You use your own accounts, and any required streaming subscriptions are purchased separately. A paid JRNY subscription is not required for direct access to the T16’s streaming apps.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Does the T16 connect to Apple Watch and Samsung Galaxy Watch?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Yes. The BowFlex T16 supports connection to compatible Apple Watch and Samsung Galaxy Watch devices to help keep workout metrics in sync. Check the current compatibility guidance for your watch model and software version.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Can I use Peloton, Zwift or Kinomap with this treadmill?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Yes. You can use compatible Peloton, Zwift and Kinomap apps through your own smartphone or tablet. Connect your compatible device to the treadmill and follow the app provider’s setup instructions. Separate app subscriptions may be required.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Does the BowFlex T16 need Wi-Fi?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Wi-Fi is required for the touchscreen’s connected fitness and entertainment apps. It is not required for basic treadmill functions such as Quick Start.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>How fast does the BowFlex T16 go, and what is the incline?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>The T16 reaches speeds of up to 20 km/h and offers up to 15% motorised incline. Quick Dial controls let you adjust speed and incline, while the MaxReact Drive System responds rapidly to changes.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>How big is the running deck, and is it cushioned?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>The running area measures 152 cm long by 56 cm wide. The Flex Zone XL Deck System includes Flex Zone cushioning to support your stride.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Does the BowFlex T16 fold, and how much space does it need?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Yes. The T16 has a folding design. Its assembled dimensions are 196 × 94 × 171.6 cm, and its stowed dimensions are 123.5 × 94 × 171.6 cm (length × width × height). Allow the additional operating and safety clearances specified in the owner’s manual; these dimensions describe the machine itself.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>What is the maximum user weight, and how heavy is the treadmill?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>The maximum user weight is 170 kg. The assembled treadmill weighs 128 kg.</p></div></details><details class=\"bfx16-faq-item\"><summary><span>Can I track my heart rate on the T16?</span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"bfx16-answer\"><p>Yes. The T16 has heart rate contact grips and supports compatible Bluetooth heart rate monitors, giving you more than one way to follow your effort while you train.</p></div></details></div></section>\n    <p class=\"bfx16-fineprint\">Personal devices shown are for illustration. App availability, watch compatibility and subscription requirements vary by provider. Entertainment subscriptions are separate from the JRNY offer. Product measurements follow the T16-21 specification.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<style>\n.bfx16{--bfx-ink:#121212;--bfx-muted:#616167;--bfx-green:#d6ffb3;--bfx-pale:#d6ffb3;--bfx-line:#e4e4e7;box-sizing:border-box;background:#ffffff;color:var(--bfx-ink);font-family:var(--font-body-family,\"Rauschen\",Arial,sans-serif);font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;padding:48px 24px;isolation:isolate;color-scheme:light}\n.bfx16 *,.bfx16 *::before,.bfx16 *::after{box-sizing:border-box}.bfx16-wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto}.bfx16 h2,.bfx16 h3,.bfx16 p,.bfx16 figure,.bfx16 dl,.bfx16 dd,.bfx16 ul{margin:0}.bfx16 h2,.bfx16 h3{font-family:inherit;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;color:inherit}.bfx16 h2{font-size:clamp(31px,3.5vw,48px);font-weight:500;letter-spacing